Relationship to Anteater API
----------------------------
This project is an independent HTTP client of the Anteater API instance hosted at
https://anteaterapi.com by ICS Student Council (ICSSC). It contains no source code
from the icssc/anteater-api repository.

It is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later by choice, matching the licence of the
upstream Anteater API server, so that code can move freely in either direction if
this work is ever contributed upstream.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official tool of ICSSC or
the University of California, Irvine.


Network use (AGPL section 13)
-----------------------------
This program can run as a network service (`anteater-mcp.mjs --http`). If you modify
it and let users interact with it remotely, section 13 of the AGPL requires you to
offer those users the Corresponding Source of your modified version.

To help you comply, the server advertises its own source location: the /health
endpoint reports it and /source redirects to it. If you deploy a fork, change the
SOURCE_URL constant in anteater-mcp.mjs to point at your repository.


